{"quest_id": 7085, "name": "崩落する迷宮", "description": "悪霊の迷宮、その深層には崩壊が進み、\n落石が襲う危険地帯が待ち受けていた！\n<ヒーラー、風水使い出撃不可>\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["ヒーラー、風水使い出撃不可"], "event": "ゴールドラッシュ27(2020)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300277, "map_no": 4028, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 24, "expression": "IsClassType(102,112,3120,312,302) == 0;"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["ステルス", "置物"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 10000, "attack": 1500, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 1500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 420, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 50, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 51, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2123520, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 4, "missile_id": 11, "master_id": 32648, "global_id": 6266, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 4, "to_ticks": 1, "to_global_id": 6267, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 27}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["ステルス", "置物"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 10000, "attack": 1500, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 1500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 420, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 50, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 51, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2123536, "special_effect_id": 548, "missile_id": 11, "master_id": 32649, "global_id": 6267, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 4, "trigger_ticks": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["エスネア＆エフネのファン"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 15, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 66, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2107936, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 958, "global_id": 957, "spawn_sec": 33}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "base_hp": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 60, "attack_speed": 50, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100208, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 232, "global_id": 231, "spawn_sec": 58}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1600, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 1600, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5499999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097344, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 14, "spawn_sec": 82}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 92}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 142, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098272, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 82, "global_id": 81, "spawn_sec": 117}], "popups": ["特定の配置マスには\n落石が発生します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "――まさか、悪霊の迷宮に\nさらなる深層が存在しているとは……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ポーラ", "text": "例の金欠冒険者たちが教えてくれたです。\nあまりに危険だから、\n調査するなら気をつけろとも言ってたですよ？", "face": "u253"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "確かにすごく危険ですわ……。\n癒やしの力を封じられるだけでなく、\n至るところで落石が起きてますもの。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "あれだけの巨石だ、剣で斬るってわけにもいかないな。\n石の落ちてこない所に陣取るしかないか。", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "オスカー", "text": "ですが、崩落箇所は徐々に広がっているようです。\n今は無事な場所であっても、\nそこがずっと安全とは言えないですね。", "face": "u366"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "何、その時はすぐに退けばいいのさ。\nさぁ王子、落石に気をつけつつ迷宮を攻略しようぜ！", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "あぁっ、癒やし手の力が封じられているという話、\nちゃんと聞いていましたの！？\nまったく、猪突猛進なんですから……。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "オスカー", "text": "ですが、そこがジェイクの\n美徳でもあるので、困ったところですね。\n――さて王子、僕らも攻略を開始しましょう。", "face": "u366"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ポーラ", "text": "わわっ、崩落で壊れた壁の向こうに、\n新しい通路があるです！", "face": "u253"}, {"name": "ジェイク", "text": "なるほど、これが悪霊の迷宮の、\nさらなる深層に続く道ってわけか。", "face": "u367"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "うぅぅ、制約だらけで大変ですのに、\nまだ続きがありますの……？", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "オスカー", "text": "冒険者としては心躍るところではありませんか？\nほら、王子も楽しそうな顔をしています。", "face": "u366"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくこく）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "はぁ、王子が乗り気なら仕方ありませんわ。\nこれからも気合を入れて調査しませんと。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――とはいえ、今日は一度地上に戻りましょう。\n迷宮の探索には時間がかかりますからね。\n王子も、此度の調査お疲れさまでした！", "face": "l839d9d7ea579"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map4028", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 921, "y": 256}, {"k": "m", "x": 136, "y": 231, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 758, "y": 335, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 259, "y": 169, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 360, "y": 118, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 554, "y": 444, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 654, "y": 391, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 349, "y": 344, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 568, "y": 227, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 464, "y": 172, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 663, "y": 277, "